# Artifacts a pipeline run leaves in the checkout.
#
# The propose job downloads these into the repository root, so without this
# they are one `git add -A` from being committed as registry documents. They
# are also excluded from the manifest by pipeline/lib/manifest.mjs, and a test
# asserts that -- this file is the second of the two guards, not the only one.
candidates.json
candidates-clean.json
candidates-fixture.json
regressions.json
signals.json
proposals.json
scan-clean.json
scan-fixture.json
matrix.xml
.pr-body.md

# Never in a public repository, and this repository had no .gitignore at all
# until the pipeline needed one.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

node_modules/
